  "headword": "although",
  "ipa": [
    "ɔːlˈðəʊ"
  ],
  "levelMark": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "conj.",
      "zh": "虽然，尽管"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "Although"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " this product is in favour of environmental protection, few people show interest in it because of its high price."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "虽然这种产品有利环保，但因其价格昂贵，几乎无人问津。"
    }
  ],
  "compare": [
    {
      "words": "although, though",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "although 和 though 作“尽管，虽然”解时，用法基本相同，但 although 更为书面化，更正式。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "She kept on working "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "although"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " she was tired. 她虽疲劳但仍继续工作。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "though 作连词时相当于 although 和 as；作副词时，要放在句末。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Old "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "though/as"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " he is, he still works in the factory. 他虽然那么大年纪，但仍在工厂工作。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "注意"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 一个句子中，although 和 but 不能连用，用了 although，就不能用 but，反之亦然。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
